title: Hap1 with an empty edit, copied ranges and a repeating edit
author: Amrit Rosell — derived from our own CC0 fixtures (procedural pattern dxvkit_plus_core::testpattern::tiles; the top tile row encodes the source frame index)
source: Written by scripts/make-edit-list-fixtures.swift with AVFoundation (AVMutableMovie edits, AVAssetWriter for the H.264) on macOS 27.0.1 from tiles_hap1.mov: an empty edit of 7 ms (movie scale 1000, media 15360: the edit starts between media ticks), source frames 5..14 and 2..5 copied (14 samples), then a second edit playing 5..7 again (17 frames play)
